{"id":"CVE-2021-34083","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2022-06-01T14:31:52.000Z","updated":"2024-08-04T00:05:52.447Z","description":"Google-it is a Node.js package which allows its users to send search queries to Google and receive the results in a JSON format. When using the 'Open in browser' option in versions up to 1.6.2, google-it will unsafely concat the result's link retrieved from google to a shell command, potentially exposing the server to RCE.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://advisory.checkmarx.net/advisory/CX-2021-4777","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/PatNeedham/google-it/blob/v1.6.2/lib/googleIt.js#L59","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/PatNeedham/google-it/blob/v1.6.2/src/googleIt.js#L34","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["nodejs"]}
