{"id":"CVE-2021-46708","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2022-03-11T06:47:56.000Z","updated":"2024-08-04T05:17:41.728Z","description":"The swagger-ui-dist package before 4.1.3 for Node.js could allow a remote attacker to hijack the clicking action of the victim. By persuading a victim to visit a malicious Web site, a remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability to hijack the victim's click actions and possibly launch further attacks against the victim.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://security.snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-JS-SWAGGERUIDIST-2314884","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/swagger-ui-dist/v/4.1.3","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20220407-0004/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["nodejs"]}
